        <name>ao_registry</name>
        <qualifiedname>EDF_framework_t::ao_registry</qualifiedname>
        <briefdescription>
<para>Active objects registry, indexed by their priority. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>Index 0 is unused; valid entries are 1 ... <computeroutput>EDF_MAX_ACTIVE_OBJECT</computeroutput>.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="note"><para>The framework does not support unregistering; entries shall be only modified to add new active objects, never removed or replaced. </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
        </detaileddescription>
