        <name>te_registry</name>
        <qualifiedname>EDF_framework_t::te_registry</qualifiedname>
        <briefdescription>
<para>Registry of time events for all tick rates. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>Each index of this array corresponds to a specific tick rate. The user is responsible for calling <ref refid="edf__time__event_8h_1a310b5ba291f7765a5a874e360fcc10fe" kindref="member">EDF_timeEvent_tick()</ref> with the corresponding <computeroutput>tick_rate</computeroutput> index at the correct periodicity to represent the desired tick rate. </para>
